{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen-1788483981-DGP8QPBPewENvpmPJAoJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed. The `RealtimeRunner.__init__(config=...)` is the \"Runner init\" config (`RealtimeRunConfig` with `model_settings`), and `run(model_config=...)` is the per-run override. The current session code:\n\n- Never uses `run_config[\"model_settings\"]` at all (ignored → the bug).\n- Uses `model_config[\"initial_model_settings\"]` to override agent-derived settings, including on handoffs (where it clobbers the new agent's instructions/tools/handoffs).\n\nNow apply the fix to `src/agents/realtime/session.py` exactly as upstream:\n\n1. `__aenter__`: pass `starting_settings=self._model_config.get(\"initial_model_settings\", None), agent=self._current_agent`.\n2. Handoff path: `starting_settings=None, agent=self._current_agent` (handoff settings come purely from the new agent).\n3. New method signature & merge order: run_config.model_settings base → starting_settings (model_config initial) → agent-derived instructions/tools/handoffs → tracing disable.\n\nAlso update the two test files to match upstream (rename/update one test, add TestModelSettingsPrecedence, fix test_tracing call). Skip the README reshuffle — unrelated docs churn.\n\nLet me make the edits.","signature":""}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"Z.AI","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9b990b0-ca4b-481f-a781-dd48cfe3ddbd","uuid":"b19b592e-c5b8-41b7-aefc-1c6486a5a518","timestamp":"2026-09-04T01:06:31.022Z","request_id":"gen-1788483981-DGP8QPBPewENvpmPJAoJ"}
